[00:00.00] 作词 : Eddy Quintela/Christine McVie
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Eddy Quintela/Christine McVie
[02:19.52][00:16.94]If I could turn the page ([00:16.94]要是我能踏出这一步)
[02:23.15][00:20.52]In time then I'd rearrange just a day or two ([00:20.52]最终我只需一两天就能重整旗鼓)
[02:28.98][00:26.47](Close my, close my, close my eyes)（ ([00:26.47]闭上啊 闭上啊 闭上我的双眼）)
[02:34.60][00:32.00]But I couldn't find a way ([00:32.00]但我寻觅不到出路)
[02:38.38][00:35.79]So I'll settle for one day to believe in you ([00:35.79]所以我决定将就一天先相信你吧)
[02:44.23][00:41.69](Tell me, tell me, tell me lies)（ ([00:41.69]对我说啊 对我说啊 对我说谎吧）)
[02:49.45][00:46.99]Tell me lies, tell me sweet little lies ([00:46.99]对我说吧 说些甜蜜的善意谎言)
[02:53.55][00:51.08](Tell me lies, tell me, tell me lies)（ ([00:51.08]对我说啊 对我说啊 对我说谎吧）)
[02:57.10][00:54.89]Oh, no, no you can't disguise ([00:54.89]噢 不不 你难以隐瞒)
[03:01.18][00:58.80](You can't disguise, no you can't disguise)（ ([00:58.80]你难以隐瞒 不 你难以隐瞒）)
[03:04.68][01:02.27]Tell me lies, tell me sweet little lies ([01:02.27]对我说吧 说些甜蜜的善意谎言)
[01:10.44]Although I'm not making plans (虽然我没有制定计划)
[01:14.11]I hope that you understand there's a reason why (但愿你理解我是另有苦衷)
[01:20.03](Close your, close your, close your eyes)（ (闭上啊 闭上啊 闭上你的双眼）)
[01:25.73]No more broken hearts (彼此不再伤心)
[01:29.88]We're better off apart, let's give it a try (我们最好就此分开 给彼此一个机会)
[01:35.42](Tell me, tell me, tell me lies)（ (对我说啊 对我说啊 对我说谎吧）)
[01:40.57]Tell me lies, tell me sweet little lies (对我说吧 说些甜蜜的善意谎言)
[01:44.52](Tell me lies, tell me, tell me lies)（ (对我说啊 对我说啊 对我说谎吧）)
